    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2630310/extras/7a2801ce68d03790ff9f5010594223fe.avif?t=1705278848\" width=620 height=224 /></span><br><br>amazin' Mage is a top-down, randomly generated dungeon crawler in which players will be tasked with exploring the map to defeat the boss and find their missing master, all in a matter of 3 in-game days. Within this adventure, the players will be able to cast spells, brew potions, and collect items that will make defeating foes and the final boss an easier mission!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2630310/extras/9bfb9360ed728c6b7bf48e993c566a90.webp?t=1705278848\" width=50 height=50 /></span><br>CRAFTING<br>Craft unique potions that give you different effects, making combat against foes easier. Find ingredients dropped by monsters and in chests!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2630310/extras/1e0e6d1ef341c31a5ee8c8fdda44f654.webp?t=1705278848\" width=50 height=50 /></span><br>SPELLS<br>Find different spells that enflame, effect time and trap foes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2630310/extras/6ce744f1183376f08a0b11676718af7f.webp?t=1705278848\" width=50 height=50 /></span><br>RANDOM GENERATION<br>Each time you play, the game is different! Try different world appearences and explore to your heart's content!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2630310/extras/61eb55065d7c74918c517beef874e4db.webp?t=1705278848\" width=50 height=50 /></span><br>TIME / DAY SYSTEM<br>Different areas can be accessed depending if it's night and day. Work against the clock to save your master from the bosses!<br><br>REPLAY VALUE<br>There's lots of different modes of play, from Adventure mode to Challenge mode that keeps the game enjoyable each play!<br><br><strong>For more information on the Spacefarer Card Game, visit </strong>",
